const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文利用与个人交易记录相连的社交网络，研究社交互动是否会影响交易者的处置效应。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article examines whether social interaction contributes to traders' disposition effect using a social network linked to individual trading records. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhw063",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它利用零售经纪商分阶段与社交交易平台合作的暴露，并比较暴露前后活动以估计同伴效应。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It exploits staggered brokerage partnerships with a social trading platform and compares activity before and after exposure to estimate peer effects. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhw063",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"输入包括获得许可的账户交易、网络暴露和进入时点、实现损益标签、经纪商与平台身份，以及可比暴露前时期。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"Inputs include consented or lawfully accessible account-level trades, network exposure and entry timing, realization labels, brokerage and platform identities, and a comparable pre-period. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhw063",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要报告特定环境中的关联和识别设计；社交活动并不证明任何个体存在偏误或可预测其未来交易。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The paper's abstract reports an association and a stated identification design in its setting; social activity is not proof of any individual's bias or future trading behavior. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhw063",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留暴露定义和分阶段时点；分析前定义实现盈亏；保护隐私；处理选择、账户活动和经纪政策变化。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Preserve exposure definition and staggered timing; define realized gains and losses before analysis; protect privacy; account for selection, account activity, and brokerage-policy changes. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhw063",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Review of Financial Studies (2016)。受限个人记录和单一平台环境不能用公开社交帖子替代，也不得用于画像个人、荐股或推测意图。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Review of Financial Studies (2016). Restricted individual records and one platform setting cannot be replaced by public social posts or used to profile a person, recommend trades, or infer intent. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hhw063",label:{zh:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · 来源说明",en:"Review of Financial Studies (2016) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Peer Pressure: Social Interaction and the Disposition Effect”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。受限个人记录和单一平台环境不能用公开社交帖子替代，也不得用于画像个人、荐股或推测意图。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Peer Pressure: Social Interaction and the Disposition Effect”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
